, this could be an interesting project for an investor, builder or experienced renovator looking for their next opportunity. Property is being sold as-is, where-is. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$314,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bi-level"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","1"],["Living area","771 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,000 sq ft"],["Year built","1960"],["Neighbourhood","Mayfield"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5P2W3"],["MLS® number","E4510533"],["Listed","September 26, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Hood Fan"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.49 m × 5.24 m (11'5\" × 17'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.49 m × 2.23 m (11'5\" × 7'4\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.50 m × 2.45 m (11'6\" × 8'0\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.49 m × 3.03 m (11'5\" × 9'11\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.48 m × 2.41 m (11'5\" × 7'11\")"]],"courtesy":"Jolene Langelle, RE/MAX Elite","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"mayfield","area":"northwest-edmonton"}